  {
    "id": "200662070448291_1613430124125926",
    "message": "It's feeling tropical in Fresno, Ohio--what better time to bring out the \"banana beer?\"  Our Hefe-Weizen is refreshing and light, with the classic banana, lemon and spice notes of a german wheat beer.  However, like our hardy banana plants, there's no fruit in this beer.  #nobananaswerehurt #yeswehavenobananas \nVisit Coshocton, Ohio! @visitcoshocton Ohio Craft Beer @ohiocraftbeer",
